	(text "Floppy 'Berg' power header. +5V feeds the module's VSYS through Schottky D1\nso USB and floppy power can be connected together. +12V (J2 pin 4) is a\nheader pad only: unused on the board. J2 is UNKEYED - reversed, +12V reaches VSYS."
