	(text "SDA = GP18 (pin 24), SCL = GP19 (pin 25), VCC = 3V3 (pin 36),\nGND = pin 23. The module's own pull-ups go to its VCC, so it\nmust stay on 3V3: RP2350 GPIOs are not 5 V tolerant. Never\nuse the PIM726 Qw/ST connector (hardwired to GP4/GP5 = MTR/DIR)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 172.72 241.3 0)
		(effects
